  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Finishing his story in the office, Chef Barinov jokes to Lyova that swallowing the ring was not even a blunder—it was the universe itself trying to save Nagiyev from marrying Kristina. Out at the bar, meanwhile, Kostya hands Max the hefty bill for the expensive cognac they drank while swapping stories.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я подумал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Дело же не в нем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Давай выпьем за нас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "За нас?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "До дна.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что это был косяк.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Потому что вся вселенная не хотела.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Чтобы хозяин женился на этой стерве.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "А я сейчас серьезно говорю, между прочим.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Может быть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Хозяин и не сделал бы ей предложение.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вот ваш чек.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "А вы знаете, сколько этот коньяк стоит?",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я подумал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I thought about it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Дело же не в нем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is not really about the ring.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Давай выпьем за нас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us drink to the two of us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "За нас?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To the two of us?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "До дна.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bottoms up.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что это был косяк.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That it was a blunder at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Потому что вся вселенная не хотела.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because the entire universe did not want it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Чтобы хозяин женился на этой стерве.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For the owner to marry that shrew.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "А я сейчас серьезно говорю, между прочим.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And I am speaking completely seriously right now, by the way.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Может быть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Perhaps.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Хозяин и не сделал бы ей предложение.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The owner never would have proposed to her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вот ваш чек.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here is your bill.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "А вы знаете, сколько этот коньяк стоит?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have any idea how much this cognac costs?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
