    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "That wraps up this scene as chef Barinov jokes to Lyova that the entire universe tried to stop Nagiyev from marrying Kristina, and in the dining room the bartender hands Max the bill for the expensive cognac he drank. See you next time!",
